Generated by `scripts/gen_dispatch.py` (mode `walk`) from the runtime bytecode; do not edit.

The storage layout is in docs/MAP.md.

`mapSlot` and `storageAt` are generic (usdt-verify, Evm/Storage.lean).

`ENTRIES` lists every `DUP1 PUSH4 key EQ PUSH2 destination JUMPI` of the bytecode, in the order of
